      "claim": "Fairtrade International’s certification scheme does not cover finished electronic devices such as laptops.",
      "evidence": "The official Fairtrade International product category list (agricultural goods, some raw minerals like gold) contains no entry for computers or other consumer electronics, and the certification criteria explicitly limit scope to those categories.",
